1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,750
All right so it's the next morning and we are on our way to catch the 610 ferry.
好了，到了第二天早上，我们正在去赶六点十分的渡轮。

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:06,960
It's 5 10 right now and we are very tired.
现在五点十分，我们很困。

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:12,230
But I always say while on vacation you never remember being tired you just remember all the fun stuff that you did.
但我总说，度假时你不会记得当时多累，只会记得那些好玩的事。

4
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:14,799
So that is the energy we are channeling right now.
所以现在我们就是要带着这种劲头出发。

5
00:00:14,799 --> 00:00:20,230
Hopefully we can get some coffee on the way if we have time and we will see you all in mid skit.
希望有时间在路上买点咖啡，我们到岛上见。

6
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:23,600
So the fairy port was only about 15 minutes from our hotel.
渡轮码头离酒店只有大约十五分钟。

7
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:28,639
And we were able to grab some food and coffee at duncan since that was the only thing open that early.
我们在 Dunkin 买了食物和咖啡，因为那么早只有它开门。

8
00:00:28,639 --> 00:00:35,200
And an added bonus to the early fairy time was that we got to see a beautiful sunrise and beat most of the tourist crowd.
早班船还有额外好处：看到了美丽日出，也避开了大多数游客。

9
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:42,160
Since we were making this trip during peak tourist season in july I did make reservations for the ferry a day or two ahead of time.
因为我们是在七月旅游旺季来，我按照网站建议，提前一两天预订了船票。

10
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:47,359
Since that's what was recommended on the website but there were plenty of seats still available the day that we went.
但我们去的那天，现场其实还有很多空位。

11
00:00:47,359 --> 00:00:51,040
And the ferry ride kind of feels like an attraction within itself.
坐渡轮本身感觉就像一个景点。

12
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:56,160
We took the highline ferry and it takes about an hour to get over to the island of nantucket.
我们坐 Highline 渡轮，大约一小时到楠塔基特岛。

13
00:00:56,160 --> 00:01:05,760
It was just so nice to get out on the water and the ride out of lewis bay in the hyenas harbor was just so scenic with all of the sailboats dotting the coastline.
出海的感觉真好，离开海湾和港口时，沿岸点缀着帆船，风景很美。

14
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:11,280
And you're able to see some of the gorgeous quintessential cape cod homes overlooking the water.
还能看到那些面向海面的漂亮房屋，很有科德角典型风格。

15
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:14,960
It was just really nice and relaxing to take this ride over to the island.
乘船去岛上的这段路真的舒适又放松。

16
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:19,680
Once we got to nantucket we had about an hour to kill before the first bus that we needed to catch.
到楠塔基特后，距离要坐的第一班公交还有大约一小时空闲。

17
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:25,680
So we just walked around and enjoyed the historic cobblestone streets the hydrangeas.
所以我们随便逛逛，看看历史悠久的鹅卵石街和绣球花。

18
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:30,240
And the town was really just waking up so we got a great look of it without the crowds.
小镇刚刚醒来，没有人潮，我们能好好看看它。

19
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:35,519
And this would be a great time to snap some photos and just enjoy some morning golden hour views.
这时候很适合拍照，欣赏清晨黄金时段的风景。

20
00:01:35,519 --> 00:01:39,919
At 8 15 we caught the wave bus and took it over to the town of skonset.
八点十五分我们坐上 Wave 公交，前往海滨小镇。

21
00:01:39,919 --> 00:01:43,120
And this is a great option if you don't have a car on the island.
如果在岛上没有车，这个选择很不错。

22
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:49,120
The bus was six dollars per person round trip and it's helpful to have exact change in cash if riding the bus.
当时公交往返每人六美元，作者说坐车时带刚好的现金很方便。

23
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:57,199
It was so fun to see other parts of the island along the way and I was really surprised by how much the landscape changed the closer we got to the town of sconces.
沿途看岛上其他地方很有趣，越接近小镇，景观变化越大，让我很意外。

24
00:01:57,199 --> 00:02:00,880
So once we arrived our plan was to do the sconcet bluff walk.
到了之后，我们计划走一走海崖步道。

25
00:02:00,880 --> 00:02:05,199
And I was immediately taken by the aesthetic of this quaint little town.
我立刻被这个古朴小镇的美感吸引住了。

26
00:02:05,199 --> 00:02:08,560
There were hydrangeas and flowers in every single direction.
无论看向哪里，都有绣球花和其他花。

27
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:16,079
And the homes and beach cottages were absolutely stunning with the classic shaker siding and meticulously landscaped yards.
房子和海边小屋非常漂亮，有经典的木片外墙，院子也打理得很精致。

28
00:02:16,079 --> 00:02:20,000
Just being amongst these beautiful cottages was an absolute dream.
光是置身这些美丽的小屋之间，就像做梦一样。

29
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,199
And you can find the beginning of the walk at the end of front street.
步道入口在 Front Street 的尽头。

30
00:02:23,199 --> 00:02:30,560
The sconce at bluff walk is basically a super scenic public footpath through backyards of multi million dollar homes.
这条海崖步道基本就是一条景色优美、穿过豪宅后院的公共小径。

31
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:35,760
And it does feel a little weird to be traipsing through people's backyards but it's totally allowed.
穿过别人后院确实有点奇怪，但她说这里允许这样走。

32
00:02:35,760 --> 00:02:41,440
And this footpath has constant breathtaking views of both the ocean and shrub land habitat.
一路不断能看到令人屏息的海景和灌木地带。

33
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:45,040
And the whole thing is just brimming with wildflowers blowing in the breeze.
整片地方开满野花，在微风中摇曳。

34
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:51,400
And it was just so special to enjoy this dreamy setting.
能享受这样梦幻的环境，感觉特别珍贵。

35
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:17,040
Do so I would say this is probably my favorite part of the whole trip mike is eating goldfish.
所以，这大概是整趟行程我最喜欢的部分。Mike 正吃金鱼饼干。

36
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:21,680
I mean everywhere you look it just looks like a fairy tale storybook it's so gorgeous.
真的，无论看向哪儿，都像童话书里的画面，太美了。

37
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:26,639
You have the beach on one side all of these insane houses with hydrangeas on the other side.
一边是海滩，另一边是这些让人惊叹、种着绣球花的房子。

38
00:03:26,639 --> 00:03:33,839
I mean and it's such a beautiful day you smell all of the really pretty flowers it just feels like a dream.
天气这么好，还能闻到漂亮花朵的香气，真的像梦一样。

39
00:03:33,839 --> 00:03:40,960
So we're gonna keep going and try to make it to the san katy lighthouse which is at the end of this whole thing.
我们继续走，想试着到这条路尽头的灯塔。

40
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:50,180
Um it's about a 30 minute walk ish if you're not taking a million pictures like I am but definitely my favorite thing so far.
不算我这样不停拍照的话，大概走三十分钟左右；这绝对是目前最喜欢的活动。
